ictable: its energy concentrates in a few structured frequencies. The series reads as non-stationary by the ADF/KPSS tests. Across validation windows the model ranking is unstable (Kendall tau 0.049), which favours a robust combination.", "source": "deterministic"}, "config": {"ablation": "top3_agent_gptoss_low_trimmedfilter_x1-7828be39a9", "pool_mode": "full", "score_preset": "balanced"}}
